WEBVTT - EduBridge Sample Lesson (English)

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Welcome to EduBridge: One Lesson, Online and In-Person, Every Ability.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
In this lesson, we explore accessible software engineering and inclusive design for Ethiopia.

00:09.500 --> 00:15.000
Accessibility means ensuring every student, whether deaf, hard of hearing, blind, or low-vision, can learn without barriers.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.000
We provide synchronized captions in English and Amharic, alongside Ethiopian Sign Language interpreters.

00:21.500 --> 00:27.000
For students on 2G and 3G connections, tiny offline packages allow offline study anywhere in the country.

00:27.500 --> 00:32.000
[music ends] Let us begin our journey towards truly inclusive education.

